      ],
      "summary": "Uzmi Umi's Mechanical Yeti i njime prestraši njezine prijatelje:\n\nLegacki u Everlooku (Winterspring)\nSprinkle u Gadgetzanu (Tanaris)\nQuixxil u Marshal's Refugeu (Un'Goro Crater)\n\nKad završiš, vrati Mechanical Yeti Umi.",
